<title>USA: TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, California 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>2-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>5-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Radka Zrubakova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Kim Po (U.S.) beat Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Linda Wild (U.S) beat Pam Shriver (U.S.) 6-3 6-0</p>
</text>
